   Terrab, Anass and Diaz-Moreno, Consuelo and Fuenmayor, Carlos A. and
   Heredia, Francisco J.},
Title = {Analysis of Multifloral Bee Pollen Pellets by Advanced Digital Imaging
   Applied to Functional Food Ingredients},
